# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Force the apex domain to the www subdomain (301 permanent), preserving the
# full path via :splat. Requires BOTH discoverkindred.com and
# www.discoverkindred.com to be attached as custom domains on the same Pages
# project so apex requests reach Pages and get redirected.
https://discoverkindred.com/* https://www.discoverkindred.com/:splat 301
